WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:01.763
Run the month.

3
00:00:01.763 --> 00:00:05.952
Ten records, and only signals and
the metrics pass their own checks;

4
00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:09.837
every other run found something,
as the earlier scenes showed.

5
00:00:09.837 --> 00:00:14.477
Read three metrics: protected coverage
sixty-four point three percent,

6
00:00:14.477 --> 00:00:18.801
enforcement depth two of eleven,
and detection validity one of one.

7
00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:22.738
Then append one line to a recorded
tickets file, and check again.

8
00:00:22.738 --> 00:00:25.075
Both checks fail, and name the file.

9
00:00:25.075 --> 00:00:27.960
That's what makes this
evidence and not a folder.
